      <section class="offer-strip" aria-label="Limited project intake offer"><div class="offer-banner"><div class="offer-copy"><span class="offer-kicker">LIMITED PROJECT INTAKE</span><h2>A sharper start for your next move.</h2><p>We’re opening a small number of new project slots this week. Send your brief before the intake closes.</p></div><a class="offer-cta" href="#contact">Claim your slot <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>

